teslamate-rs (0.1.0-2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Optional grouped UI (vehicle, battery, trips, software), chosen per account.
  * Live vehicle view from the last Tesla API poll (place, locks, sentry, tires, range).
  * Grouped drives and charges open in place, with the route or the power curve.
  * On a phone the date range stays a single control until opened.
  * PAM authentication, passkeys, and user profiles (AstonMate-shaped).
  * Cancel in-flight dashboard queries, cache results, and roll up GPS hourly.
  * Sync Tesla Supercharger invoices and add teslamate-rs refresh (no wake_up).

